Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.74,0:00:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mighty Little Defenders 11 – New Wild Cosmos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}The Bottomless Abyss
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Episode 49
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.38,0:12:16.94,end,,0,0,0,,To be continued
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.99,0:00:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is what it feels like in the abyss.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.03,0:00:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I still have things left to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.18,0:00:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.48,0:00:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate that it’s ending like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.31,0:00:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s happening to my body?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.51,0:00:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, I need to get out of here fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.79,0:00:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Peach.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.63,0:00:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Jonie.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.88,0:00:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.59,0:01:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Our experiment to patch the abyss failed again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.70,0:01:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re right; I shouldn’t give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.51,0:01:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s build an even more powerful device.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.67,0:01:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ve finished building my particle eliminator.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.82,0:01:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s go test it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.06,0:01:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s patched.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.71,0:01:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.22,0:02:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s happening? Everyone, get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.34,0:02:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you it wouldn’t work.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.06,0:02:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That abyss is getting bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.70,0:02:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,My particle eliminator {\i1}can{\i0} patch the abyss.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.79,0:02:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,If I just make a few more improvements…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.82,0:02:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it up. You can’t possibly save this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.98,0:02:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Just give me a little more time; I know I can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.65,0:02:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.29,0:02:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I get it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.25,0:02:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as you’re here, I won’t give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.01,0:02:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If this method doesn’t work, I can always look for another way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.77,0:02:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,So, there are other worlds out there besides ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.85,0:03:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe if I visit those other worlds,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.01,0:03:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I might find a way to repair the Bottomless Abyss.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.69,0:03:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What I just saw…those were her memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.00,0:03:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,This is our Green Green Grassland.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.21,0:03:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This is…another world?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.66,0:03:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The sunlight here feels so pleasant.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.30,0:03:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Doggy, don’t you think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.41,0:03:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this a flower?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.05,0:03:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It smells so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.08,0:03:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And what is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.36,0:04:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be that their world doesn’t have any of these things?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.38,0:04:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It would be great if our world could become like this too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.06,0:04:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe we could use the World Teleportation Device
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.50,0:04:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,to move here and live.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.98,0:04:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That way, we wouldn’t have to fear that Bottomless Abyss anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.10,0:04:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to tell everyone the news.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.50,0:04:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s happening to my body?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.65,0:05:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we fading away in other worlds, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.98,0:05:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Doggy, let’s get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.58,0:05:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Doggy, hang in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.45,0:05:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We’re going home.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.14,0:05:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m taking you home right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.21,0:05:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Doggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.59,0:05:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.27,0:05:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,No…please, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.62,0:05:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Doggy, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.22,0:05:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t leave me, Doggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.32,0:05:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Doggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.67,0:05:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Peach, hurry and leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.79,0:05:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, you’ll disappear too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.20,0:05:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Peach.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.09,0:05:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Peach.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.33,0:06:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Peach.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.80,0:06:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Peach, so all this time…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.80,0:06:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t need your sympathy. It’s all because of you guys
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.44,0:06:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,that our plan didn’t succeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.65,0:06:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Giving up already?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.05,0:06:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn’t save you just so you could give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.69,0:06:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for saving me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.93,0:06:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But since we’re all destined to fade away, why save me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.33,0:06:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What if I told you there was a way to save this world?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.80,0:06:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You said there’s a way—what kind of way?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.04,0:06:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ve been watching you for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.92,0:06:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I need someone with your inventive talent
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.59,0:06:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,to help me improve this Particle Absorption Device.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.44,0:07:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We could travel to other worlds and absorb all their energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.28,0:07:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps that would save our world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.27,0:07:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.45,0:07:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s give it a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.64,0:07:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It will work—you just have to trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.94,0:07:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I will give you back a beautiful world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.62,0:07:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Peach, you’re in charge of upgrading this device.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.61,0:07:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Enhance its absorption capabilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.83,0:07:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The rest of you, split up and help Peach find the materials.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.19,0:07:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.63,0:07:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Absorption Device upgrade complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.54,0:07:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s get started, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.84,0:07:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s so beautiful here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.38,0:08:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,How did this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.11,0:08:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We absorbed that entire world?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.51,0:08:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the energy of the whole world.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.15,0:08:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,But what about that world?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.54,0:08:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We don’t have any other choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.82,0:08:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s just save ourselves first.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.26,0:08:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s witness a miracle together.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.21,0:09:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s great! We really saved our world.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.69,0:09:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,So, that’s how they restored this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.65,0:09:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Why has it suddenly turned back into this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.40,0:09:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Wasn’t our world already restored?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.42,0:09:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is the energy disappearing again?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.10,0:09:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like we need to absorb more energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.90,0:09:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That way, our world can keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.03,0:09:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you saying we have to keep absorbing other worlds?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.95,0:09:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.75,0:09:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn’t that just shift our misfortune onto someone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.74,0:09:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s look for another way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.07,0:09:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t you guys understand? This is the only option we have left.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.23,0:09:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So, can you guys really bear
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.90,0:10:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,to watch everything in our world gradually vanish and be destroyed?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.62,0:10:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t want to face this kind of destruction over and over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.62,0:10:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m going to do it anyway; come find me once you’ve made up your minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.01,0:10:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Is what I’m doing right or wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.70,0:10:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Can anyone tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.41,0:10:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand how you feel, but I have to tell you…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.09,0:10:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,This method is wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.65,0:10:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Right or wrong doesn’t matter anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.81,0:10:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Because we are destined to fade away here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.01,0:10:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.17,0:11:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,We still have hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.82,0:11:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We could try the Reverse Punch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.90,0:11:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,How could that method possibly get us out?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.65,0:11:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We can keep trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.50,0:11:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as we keep going,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.74,0:11:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,keep trying,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.61,0:11:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,then it’s not over yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.28,0:11:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,See? We did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.24,0:11:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We can really leave this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.88,0:11:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Once we get out, my friends and I will help you too
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.08,0:11:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,find other ways to make your world a better place
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.60,0:11:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It feels so good to have hope
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.80,0:11:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it—I knew you’d come
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.29,0:12:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Peach, let me pull you up
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.25,0:12:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Pink, you…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.80,0:12:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t say anything; just hold on to me
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.72,0:12:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this the hope you kept talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.62,0:12:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I can feel it
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
